OL,3,GNEWSAWater park and hotel resort plan  
OL,4,Aapproved                               
OL,6,FThe scheme will be built on 19.3       
OL,7,Fhectares (48 acres) of agricultural    
OL,8,Fland between Barlborough, Clowne and   
OL,9,FWhitwell, with a 512-room seven-storey 
OL,10,Fhotel, indoor water park, adventure    
OL,11,Ffacilities, restaurants, 600-person    
OL,12,Fconference centre and staff            
OL,13,Faccommodation.                         
OL,15,FCouncillors approved the application by
OL,16,Fseven votes to one.                    
